          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147950,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il numero massimo di valori che un array può contenere in un gioco (come i nemici in un livello)?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quanti ne vogliamo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">10</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quanti ne vogliamo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147951,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cos'è un elemento?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un valore in un array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La condizione di un array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un valore in un array.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147952,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assegna alla variabile <code>questLog</code> un array con il valore <code>\"Collect 10 coins\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Defeat the dragon&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" questLog = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Collect 10 coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Quest Log:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(questLog);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>[</code>, seguito da <code>\"Collect 10 coins\"</code> e infine <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147953,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un array che memorizzi <code>\"forest\"</code> e <code>\"dungeon\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levels = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dungeon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levels);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>[</code>, seguito da <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147954,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ \"\" ]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ inventory ]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147955,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è l'indice di <code>\"slime\"</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147956,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiorna il secondo elemento impostandolo su <code>\"Mage\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"party[2]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Paladin&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"53\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" party = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Rogue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"party[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(party);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>party[1]</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"Mage\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147957,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è l'ultimo indice a cui possiamo accedere in questo array?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" checkpointsReached = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147958,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi <code>\"Meg\"</code> all'indice <code>0</code> e <code>\"Max\"</code> all'indice <code>1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Meg\"</code>, seguito da <code>\"Max\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147959,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come accediamo al valore <code>22</code> in questo array?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreMilestones = [\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>scoreMilestones[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>scoreMilestones[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>scoreMilestones(2)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>scoreMilestones[2]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147960,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fa <code>.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Rimuove l'ultimo valore di un array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Rimuove il primo valore di un array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Rimuove un valore casuale da un array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Rimuove l'ultimo valore di un array.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147961,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fa <code>.push()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiunge un valore a un array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Rimuove un valore da un array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Crea un array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiunge un valore a un array.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 147962,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi <code>\"Health Potion\"</code> a questo array dell'inventario.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Mana Potion&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"76\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wooden Sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"inventory.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>inventory</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>push</code>, <code>\"Health Potion\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 147963,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è l'indice di <code>\"Fire Rune\"</code> nell'array, dopo averlo aggiunto con <code>push()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" runes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ice Rune&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"runes.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Fire Rune&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(runes);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 147964,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il valore di <code>lastLife</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" extraLives = [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lastLife = extraLives.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lastLife);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 147965,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quanti elementi contiene un array vuoto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 147966,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizzerà questo frammento di codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bosses = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime King&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin Chief&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Stone Golem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shadow Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"bosses.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"bosses.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bosses.length);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"6\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 147967,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizzerà questo frammento di codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lootBag = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lootBag.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lootBag.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;map&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lootBag);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"coin\", \"gem\", \"key\", \"potion\", \"map\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"coin\", \"gem\", \"key\", \"potion\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">5</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[\"coin\", \"gem\", \"key\", \"potion\", \"map\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
